## The commands, as the stages were run

Environment: OFX_SOURCE_DIR=./.ofx-ref, ONNXRUNTIME_ROOT=.validation/ort-1.32.0,
VULKAN_SDK=.validation/vk/sdk, no CPU_ONLY, no SANITIZE, no RUN_VALGRIND. Windows
route: the .bat runners, one per template. Stage commands:

  docs                   check-docs.py, its --selftest, check-workflows.py, check-shell.sh
  provenance             check-provenance.py --self-test, then the scan
  minimal-ofx            build, artifact, contract x5, install/load
  minimal-cuda-ofx       build, artifact, GPU harness, contract x3, the gpux run, mode gates
  minimal-opencl-ofx     build, path policy, artifact, contract x3 + the forced-CPU pass, opencl_suite
  minimal-vulkan-ofx     build, path policy, artifact, contract x7 + device label, vulkan_suite
  onnx-inference-ofx     build.bat, then test/test.bat
  negative-controls      testkit/run-negative-controls.bat

## What this pass does not say

# A cold checkout additionally compiles four templates and the inference
# plug-in, which is the larger cost and depends on the toolchain. Nothing was
# measured inside a host or on a second GPU here.
